e chamber. Perhaps I am premature, but I have not heard what he was talking about. I am terribly interested, because I have not had a good laugh for a while! Perhaps he could start again. Stephen Parry That is not a point of order. Senator","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-2277","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2012-03-21/1"}
